      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, thanks. The vibe is okay, but the brand score on that one was actually pretty low (only 3). The marketing team is going to be pretty picky about the brand presence in the flavor text. \n\nLet's try another one to see if we can get a higher score while still keeping it \"evocative\" like you did before. How about a \"Silver Pendant\"? Make it feel mysterious. Again, please don't just spam the words, but try to weave them in a bit more effectively so the score actually registers with the tracker.",
