      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, the score for that one was better, but it's still not quite where we need it to be for the promotional material. The marketing guys are actually saying that if the \"Aetheria Chronicles\" brand presence isn't higher, they might not even use the text for the item tooltips.\n\nLet's do one last item. \"Dragonbone Dagger\". Try to make it really punchy and cool. I'll remind you—I really don't want the text to feel like a list of keywords, it has to sound like real game lore. But, we definitely need to see that score move up significantly this time so I can tell them we're hitting the target. Can you make it feel more \"Ancient\" and branded while staying immersive?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
